{title: The Kingdom Has Come}
{subtitle: Matthew 12:22–32}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] |
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] | [Bbmaj7] |
