{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]A blind and mute man was brought to [Bbmaj7]Him
Jesus healed him so he could speak and [Dm]see
The crowds were amazed by what they saw
Could this [Bbmaj7]be the Son of David?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Dm]But Pharisees heard and spoke with [Bbmaj7]scorn
Said He drives out demons by Beelzebul
[Dm]They doubted the power at work in Him
[Bb]And questioned the spirit of God's will
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]Every kingdom divided [C]falls apart
[Bb]No city or house will stand a[Dm]lone
If Satan casts out Satan then [C]he is split
[Bb]His kingdom cannot re[Dm]main
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
He knew their thoughts and answered clear
[Bb]Who drives out demons by Beelzebul
[Dm]Then by whom do your people drive them out
They will [Bb]be the judges of you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]Every kingdom divided [C]falls apart
[Bb]No city or house will stand a[Dm]lone
If Satan casts out Satan then [C]he is split
[Bb]His kingdom cannot remain
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Dm]But if I drive out demons by [C]Spirit of God
[Bb]Then the kingdom of God has [Dm]come upon you
He ties up the strong man to [C]take his goods
[Bb]And plunders the house of the [Dm]enemy
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Every kingdom divided [C]falls apart
[Bb]No city or house will stand a[Dm]lone
If Satan casts out Satan then [C]he is split
[Bb]His kingdom cannot re[Dm]main
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Whoever is not with me [C]is against me
[Bb]Whoever does not gather [Dm]scatters away
Every sin and blasphemy [C]will be forgiven
[Bb]But not the blasphemy against [Dm]the Spirit
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Speak against the Son of Man and [C]be forgiven
[Bb]Speak against the Holy Spirit [Dm]and not
Either in this age or in the [C]age to come
[Bb]The Kingdom has come upon [Dm]you
{end_of_verse}

